WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Ryu lands from the prerequisite Arc-Step kick.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.200
The raw Rush approaches during wake-up.

3
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.800
Rush standing heavy kick connects.

4
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.550
Standing heavy punch links after the kick.

5
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.700
Heavy Vagabond Edge launches.

6
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.800
The air grab catches Ryu in the juggle.

7
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.050
The branch ends in hard knockdown.
